From 9ef3ccbb095793c8f3e3351a3a6574c037cbdd38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v8-build <v8@build>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:30:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] jidu6j11: v8 adjustments

- pin package/kernel/mac80211 to the JIDU6J11-PR version (backports 6.18.39 +
  IPQ9574 AHB patches) that is proven on this hardware; upstream moved to 7.2
- accept sysupgrade from earlier images (board name jiorouter,ax6000-jidu6j11)
- ship the JIDU6J11 ath11k board data as a local package (not yet in qca-wireless)
- default WiFi country PA (as in the earlier images)
- upgrade/uboot-env scripts match every jiorouter,ax6000-jidu6j11* board name
